sonora (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First stable release.
  * Playback with GStreamer; multiple playlists (tabs, manager, columns,
    filter, sorting, metadata tooltips, import/export M3U/PLS/XSPF).
  * CUE sheet support (cue + FLAC/APE/WV/WAV/MP3 images).
  * LED level meters with true-peak detection and a configurable spectrum
    analyser, both synchronised with the sound.
  * Selectable sound service and device, dark mode, MPRIS2 media keys.
  * Documentation rewritten, licence text (COPYING) and .gitignore added,
    desktop file registers cue sheets and playlists.

